    "title": "Car Fire Shuts Down Eastbound Traffic on State Route 62 Near Indian Canyon - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joel Killam ,\n1 hours ago RIVERSIDE COUNTY, Calif. (KESQ) — A reported car fire blocked eastbound lanes of State Route 62 near Indian Canyon Wednesday evening, causing major traffic delays. A News Channel 3 crew observed traffic backed up between Indian Canyon and Pierson Boulevard as vehicles headed uphill toward Morongo Valley. Fire crews were dispatched, but gridlock made access difficult. Authorities requested additional assistance for traffic control. No injuries have been reported at this time.\nThis is a developing story. Stay with News Channel 3 for updates.\nThe post Car Fire Shuts Down Eastbound Traffic on State Route 62 Near Indian Canyon appeared first on KESQ .\n1",
